<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  From the Admin area select Companies from the navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Launch the company document that you want to modify</run></par>
